## Core Principles
Wagmi v3.x (latest v3.3.2), handle wallet connection states, see @.cursor/rules/web3/viem.mdc for address validation

## Wallet auth, link
For wallet auth and link flows, use app-local hooks from `@/hooks/` and `@/wallet/`: `useWalletAuth`, `useLinkWallet`, `useWallet` (from `@/hooks/use-wallet`, `@/hooks/use-wallet-auth`, `@/hooks/use-link-wallet`). `WalletProvider` and `WalletAdaptersInjector` in `@/wallet/`. Do not call auth/link APIs directly from app code.

## Custom Hooks
Create specialized hooks for contract interactions. Use `useAccount`, `useWriteContract`, extract ABI types with `AbiParametersToPrimitiveTypes` and `ExtractAbiFunction`, check account connection, let wagmi infer chain

## Error Handling
Consider network conditions and gas price fluctuations
